UnitWarpMessengerStub
├── when reading the blockchain ID
│   ├── given an ID was configured
│   │   └── it returns the configured ID
│   └── given the ID was changed again
│       └── it returns the latest ID
├── when sending a warp message
│   ├── given one payload
│   │   ├── it records the payload
│   │   ├── it returns a message ID
│   │   └── it emits WarpMessageSent
│   └── given two different payloads in order
│       ├── it records both in send order
│       └── it returns different IDs
└── when reading a verified message
    ├── given a message injected at index 0
    │   └── it returns the message with valid true
    ├── given nothing injected at the index
    │   └── it returns valid false
    └── given index 0 already holds a message
        └── it returns the second message after an overwrite
